{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategy","title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/migration-strategy","wordCount":1202,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"迁移策略\">迁移策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>遗留代码库向 DI 的迁移不可能一夜完成，需要一条渐进的、可验证的路径。核心策略是 Strangler Fig 模式——新代码强制使用 DI，旧代码通过识别 Seam 点、提取接口、包装为 DI 兼容形式逐模块迁入容器管理。关键纪律是&quot;新代码绝不允许直接 new 易变依赖&quot;，这确保遗留代码的占比随时间自然下降。推荐从叶子模块开始向核心逐步推进，避免大爆炸式全量迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"遗留代码的现实\">遗留代码的现实</h2><p>大多数生产系统不是从零开始使用 DI 的——它们经历了多年迭代，积累了大量直接 <code>new</code>、静态调用和 Singleton 模式的遗留代码。一夜之间重写整个系统既不现实也不安全。需要的是一条<strong>渐进的、可验证的、低风险的</strong>迁移路径。</p>\n<p>典型遗留代码的依赖管理现状：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>代码特征</th>\n<th>迁移难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接 new</td>\n<td><code>new MySQLRepo(new Connection(...))</code></td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态方法</td>\n<td><code>DatabaseHelper.getConnection()</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经典 Singleton</td>\n<td><code>OrderService.getInstance()</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>God Object</td>\n<td>一个类依赖 15+ 个具体实现</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局可变状态</td>\n<td><code>public static Config config;</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;迁移路径&quot;&#10;        A[遗留代码: 紧耦合] --&gt; B[识别 Seam 点]&#10;        B --&gt; C[引入接口抽象]&#10;        C --&gt; D[新代码使用 DI]&#10;        D --&gt; E[逐模块迁移旧代码]&#10;        E --&gt; F[全面 DI + Composition Root]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"迁移路径\"\n        A[遗留代码: 紧耦合] --&gt; B[识别 Seam 点]\n        B --&gt; C[引入接口抽象]\n        C --&gt; D[新代码使用 DI]\n        D --&gt; E[逐模块迁移旧代码]\n        E --&gt; F[全面 DI + Composition Root]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"阶段一-识别-seam-点\">阶段一：识别 Seam 点</h2><p>Michael Feathers 在《Working Effectively with Legacy Code》中定义了 <strong>Seam</strong>（接缝）的概念：代码中可以改变行为而不需要修改该位置代码本身的点。</p>\n<p>寻找 Seam 点的方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 遗留代码&#10;public class InvoiceProcessor {&#10;    public void process(Invoice invoice) {&#10;        // Seam 点 1：数据库访问可以被隔离&#10;        Connection conn = DriverManager.getConnection(DB_URL);&#10;        PreparedStatement stmt = conn.prepareStatement(&quot;INSERT ...&quot;);&#10;&#10;        // Seam 点 2：外部服务调用可以被替换&#10;        HttpClient client = HttpClient.newHttpClient();&#10;        client.send(buildRequest(invoice), BodyHandlers.ofString());&#10;&#10;        // Seam 点 3：文件系统操作可以被抽象&#10;        Files.write(Path.of(&quot;/archive/&quot; + invoice.id()), invoice.toBytes());&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 遗留代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvoiceProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Invoice </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">invoice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // Seam 点 1：数据库访问可以被隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Connection conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DriverManager.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(DB_URL);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        PreparedStatement stmt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepareStatement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INSERT ...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // Seam 点 2：外部服务调用可以被替换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        HttpClient client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HttpClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">newHttpClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">buildRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(invoice), BodyHandlers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // Seam 点 3：文件系统操作可以被抽象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Files.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/archive/\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> invoice.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), invoice.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个外部依赖点（数据库、网络、文件系统、时间、随机数）都是潜在的 Seam 点——可以在这里&quot;切开&quot;代码，插入接口抽象。</p>\n<p><strong>优先级排序</strong>：先迁移最频繁修改的模块（变更频率高 = 投资回报高）和最需要测试覆盖的模块（bug 密度高 = 风险最大）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"阶段二-extract-interface\">阶段二：Extract Interface</h2><p>在识别的 Seam 点引入接口，将具体实现隐藏在接口后面：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 步骤 1：提取接口&#10;public interface InvoiceRepository {&#10;    void save(Invoice invoice);&#10;    Invoice findById(String id);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 步骤 2：将遗留实现包装为接口实现&#10;public class JdbcInvoiceRepository implements InvoiceRepository {&#10;    public void save(Invoice invoice) {&#10;        // 原有的 JDBC 代码搬到这里&#10;        Connection conn = DriverManager.getConnection(DB_URL);&#10;        // ...&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 步骤 3：业务类改为依赖接口（但先保持 new 创建）&#10;public class InvoiceProcessor {&#10;    private final InvoiceRepository repository;&#10;&#10;    public InvoiceProcessor() {&#10;        // 暂时仍然自己 new —— 后续阶段才切到容器注入&#10;        this.repository = new JdbcInvoiceRepository();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 新增：支持外部传入的构造函数（为测试和未来 DI 准备）&#10;    public InvoiceProcessor(InvoiceRepository repository) {&#10;        this.repository = repository;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 1：提取接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvoiceRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Invoice </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">invoice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Invoice </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 2：将遗留实现包装为接口实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JdbcInvoiceRepository</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvoiceRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Invoice </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">invoice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 原有的 JDBC 代码搬到这里</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Connection conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DriverManager.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(DB_URL);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 3：业务类改为依赖接口（但先保持 new 创建）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvoiceProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> InvoiceRepository repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvoiceProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 暂时仍然自己 new —— 后续阶段才切到容器注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.repository </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JdbcInvoiceRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 新增：支持外部传入的构造函数（为测试和未来 DI 准备）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvoiceProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(InvoiceRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.repository </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个中间状态的价值：<strong>现有代码行为不变</strong>（无参构造函数保持原样），但新增了可注入的入口，测试可以立即使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Test&#10;void testProcess_savesInvoice() {&#10;    var mockRepo = mock(InvoiceRepository.class);&#10;    var processor = new InvoiceProcessor(mockRepo); // 使用注入构造函数&#10;&#10;    processor.process(testInvoice);&#10;&#10;    verify(mockRepo).save(testInvoice);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testProcess_savesInvoice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mockRepo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(InvoiceRepository.class);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvoiceProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockRepo); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用注入构造函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    processor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(testInvoice);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockRepo).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(testInvoice);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"阶段三-strangler-fig-模式\">阶段三：Strangler Fig 模式</h2><p>Strangler Fig（绞杀者模式）源自 Martin Fowler——新代码逐步包裹并替换旧代码，直到旧代码完全被&quot;绞杀&quot;消失。在 DI 迁移中的应用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段 A:新代码使用 DI&quot;&#10;        New[新模块] --&gt; Container[IoC 容器]&#10;        Old[旧模块] --&gt; DirectNew[直接 new]&#10;        Container --&gt; Adapter[适配器包装旧模块]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段 B:旧模块逐个迁入&quot;&#10;        Container2[IoC 容器]&#10;        Container2 --&gt; New2[新模块]&#10;        Container2 --&gt; Migrated[已迁移的旧模块]&#10;        Old2[剩余旧模块] --&gt; DirectNew2[直接 new]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段 C:全面 DI&quot;&#10;        Container3[IoC 容器]&#10;        Container3 --&gt; All[所有模块通过 DI 管理]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"阶段 A:新代码使用 DI\"\n        New[新模块] --&gt; Container[IoC 容器]\n        Old[旧模块] --&gt; DirectNew[直接 new]\n        Container --&gt; Adapter[适配器包装旧模块]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"阶段 B:旧模块逐个迁入\"\n        Container2[IoC 容器]\n        Container2 --&gt; New2[新模块]\n        Container2 --&gt; Migrated[已迁移的旧模块]\n        Old2[剩余旧模块] --&gt; DirectNew2[直接 new]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"阶段 C:全面 DI\"\n        Container3[IoC 容器]\n        Container3 --&gt; All[所有模块通过 DI 管理]\n    end</pre><p><strong>关键原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>新代码必须使用 DI</strong>——绝不允许新写的代码直接 <code>new</code> 易变依赖</li>\n<li><strong>旧代码按优先级迁移</strong>——不要试图一次性迁移所有代码</li>\n<li><strong>保持双向兼容</strong>——迁移期间，旧代码和新代码共存</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"阶段四-建立-composition-root\">阶段四：建立 Composition Root</h2><p>当足够多的模块迁移到 DI 后，建立正式的 Composition Root：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 初始的 Composition Root——混合新旧&#10;@Configuration&#10;public class AppConfig {&#10;&#10;    // 新模块：完全通过 DI 管理&#10;    @Bean&#10;    public OrderService orderService(OrderRepository repo, PricingEngine pricing) {&#10;        return new OrderService(repo, pricing);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 迁移中的模块：包装遗留实现&#10;    @Bean&#10;    public InvoiceRepository invoiceRepository() {&#10;        return new JdbcInvoiceRepository(); // 遗留实现，未来替换&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 尚未迁移的模块：通过适配器桥接&#10;    @Bean&#10;    public LegacyReportService legacyReportService() {&#10;        // 直接调用旧的 Singleton，未来迁移&#10;        return LegacyReportService.getInstance();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 初始的 Composition Root——混合新旧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Configuration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 新模块：完全通过 DI 管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Bean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrderService </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(OrderRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, PricingEngine </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pricing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(repo, pricing);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 迁移中的模块：包装遗留实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Bean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> InvoiceRepository </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoiceRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JdbcInvoiceRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 遗留实现，未来替换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 尚未迁移的模块：通过适配器桥接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Bean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LegacyReportService </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">legacyReportService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 直接调用旧的 Singleton，未来迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LegacyReportService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"迁移检查清单\">迁移检查清单</h2><p>每个模块迁移前后的验证项：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>迁移前</td>\n<td>现有测试通过（如果有）</td>\n<td>运行测试套件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提取接口后</td>\n<td>行为不变——旧测试仍然通过</td>\n<td>回归测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引入 DI 后</td>\n<td>新注入方式与旧 new 方式行为一致</td>\n<td>对比测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除旧 new 后</td>\n<td>所有消费者改用容器解析</td>\n<td>编译 + 集成测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移完成</td>\n<td>无参构造函数删除，只保留注入构造函数</td>\n<td>编译验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见迁移陷阱\">常见迁移陷阱</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    Pitfall1[大爆炸式迁移] --&gt; Risk1[风险:一次性修改数百文件,无法定位回归]&#10;    Pitfall2[只加接口不加测试] --&gt; Risk2[风险:接口抽象正确性无保证]&#10;    Pitfall3[在旧代码中强行使用容器] --&gt; Risk3[风险:Service Locator 反模式]&#10;    Pitfall4[迁移顺序不当] --&gt; Risk4[风险:先迁移被广泛依赖的底层模块导致大面积改动]&#10;&#10;    Risk1 --&gt; Fix1[修复:每次只迁移一个 Seam 点]&#10;    Risk2 --&gt; Fix2[修复:提取接口同时补充特征测试]&#10;    Risk3 --&gt; Fix3[修复:旧代码保持 new,新代码用构造器注入]&#10;    Risk4 --&gt; Fix4[修复:从叶子模块开始,向核心逐步推进]\">graph TB\n    Pitfall1[大爆炸式迁移] --&gt; Risk1[风险:一次性修改数百文件,无法定位回归]\n    Pitfall2[只加接口不加测试] --&gt; Risk2[风险:接口抽象正确性无保证]\n    Pitfall3[在旧代码中强行使用容器] --&gt; Risk3[风险:Service Locator 反模式]\n    Pitfall4[迁移顺序不当] --&gt; Risk4[风险:先迁移被广泛依赖的底层模块导致大面积改动]\n\n    Risk1 --&gt; Fix1[修复:每次只迁移一个 Seam 点]\n    Risk2 --&gt; Fix2[修复:提取接口同时补充特征测试]\n    Risk3 --&gt; Fix3[修复:旧代码保持 new,新代码用构造器注入]\n    Risk4 --&gt; Fix4[修复:从叶子模块开始,向核心逐步推进]</pre><p><strong>推荐迁移顺序</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>最外层（HTTP Controller / CLI Entry）——最容易引入容器</li>\n<li>叶子服务（无其他服务依赖它）——改动影响面最小</li>\n<li>中间层服务——依赖已迁移的叶子服务</li>\n<li>核心共享服务——最后迁移，此时所有消费者已适配</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"迁移完成度的度量\">迁移完成度的度量</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DI 覆盖率</td>\n<td>通过 DI 创建的服务数 / 总服务数</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接 new 密度</td>\n<td>业务代码中 new 易变依赖的次数</td>\n<td>趋近 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试覆盖率</td>\n<td>单元测试可覆盖的代码比例</td>\n<td>显著高于迁移前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Composition Root 集中度</td>\n<td>容器注册代码是否集中在入口</td>\n<td>100% 集中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>迁移不是一次性项目，而是持续的工程纪律。关键不在于&quot;何时迁移完成&quot;，而在于&quot;新代码是否始终遵循 DI 原则&quot;——只要守住这条线，遗留代码的占比会随时间自然下降。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>遗留系统向 DI 的迁移是渐进工程而非一次性项目。四阶段路径（识别 Seam → 提取接口 → Strangler Fig → 建立 Composition Root）已在大量现实项目中验证有效。关键纪律是守住&quot;新代码必须使用 DI&quot;这条线——只要这条线不破，系统的 DI 覆盖率会随自然迭代持续上升。从叶子模块向核心推进、每步有测试保护、避免大爆炸式全量迁移，是控制风险的核心策略。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>相关文档：<a href=\"anti-patterns\">反模式</a> 帮助识别迁移过程中可能引入的新反模式。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迁移策略","id":"迁移策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"遗留代码的现实","id":"遗留代码的现实"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段一：识别 Seam 点","id":"阶段一-识别-seam-点"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段二：Extract Interface","id":"阶段二-extract-interface"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段三：Strangler Fig 模式","id":"阶段三-strangler-fig-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段四：建立 Composition Root","id":"阶段四-建立-composition-root"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移检查清单","id":"迁移检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"常见迁移陷阱","id":"常见迁移陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移完成度的度量","id":"迁移完成度的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"反模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/anti-patterns"},"next":null}